{"parse":{"title":"铃兰之剑「极心测试」FAQ","pageid":3146,"revid":6698,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%E3%80%8C%E6%9E%81%E5%BF%83%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E3%80%8DFAQ&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%E3%80%8C%E6%9E%81%E5%BF%83%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E3%80%8DFAQ&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%E3%80%8C%E6%9E%81%E5%BF%83%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E3%80%8DFAQ&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF\" title=\"官方消息\">官方消息</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A\" title=\"公告\">公告</a> &gt; <b>铃兰之剑「极心测试」FAQ</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E9.93.83.E5.85.B0.E4.B9.8B.E5.89.91.E3.80.8C.E6.9E.81.E5.BF.83.E6.B5.8B.E8.AF.95.E3.80.8DFAQ\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"铃兰之剑「极心测试」FAQ\">铃兰之剑「极心测试」FAQ</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%E3%80%8C%E6%9E%81%E5%BF%83%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E3%80%8DFAQ&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：铃兰之剑「极心测试」FAQ\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：极心测试的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-09-15 16:52<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2F76sBNGuXM4bW_WWZEBLZ2Q\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/76sBNGuXM4bW_WWZEBLZ2Q</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息192.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7e/7wqg3rxspr8ssr5i5u99gd0u5952a2p.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF192.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"149\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7e/7wqg3rxspr8ssr5i5u99gd0u5952a2p.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"200\" /><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>Q：测试资格怎么获得？</b><br />\nA：极心测试将于9月27日开启，测试资格会在<font color=\"gray\"><b>9月26日</b></font>开放预下载时在<font color=\"gray\"><b>TapTap（安卓端）</b></font>放出，本次测试资格<font color=\"gray\"><b>限量抢注</b></font>，团长们先到先得哦~在游戏内创建角色成功即获得资格，不以下载游戏为准。<br />\n另外，<font color=\"gray\"><b>2022年参与保密测试并签署保密协议</b></font>的团长，可以直接拥有测试资格。<br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>Q：怎么下载安装？</b><br />\nA：<font color=\"gray\"><b>9月26日12:00 </b></font>预下载开启时，将会在<font color=\"gray\"><b>TapTap安卓端-铃兰之剑 页面</b></font>开放下载地址。团长直接点击下载就可以啦！<br />*本次测试入口<font color=\"gray\"><b>仅在TapTap安卓端开放</b></font>，iOS及PC端团长请移步安卓端进行预下载。<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息220.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/102imddlkdvfet11r276j0xbkvy71ub.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF220.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"175\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/102imddlkdvfet11r276j0xbkvy71ub.png/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF220.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/07/102imddlkdvfet11r276j0xbkvy71ub.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"338\" />\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>Q：有没有具体的机型要求？</b><br />\nA：本次测试仅开放<font color=\"gray\"><b>TapTap安卓安装包</b></font>，暂不支持iOS和PC。<font color=\"gray\"><b>安卓设备</b></font>配置要求如下：<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息221.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/59/jr82lepy11g86o63mwkih1nsoz9fwzg.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF221.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"135\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/59/jr82lepy11g86o63mwkih1nsoz9fwzg.png/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF221.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/59/jr82lepy11g86o63mwkih1nsoz9fwzg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"869\" data-file-height=\"209\" />\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>Q：极心测试能否充值？</b><br />\nA：本次测试为<font color=\"gray\"><b>限量付费删档测试</b></font>，开放<font color=\"gray\"><b>充值入口</b></font>，充值金额将在<font color=\"gray\"><b>正式服以资源</b></font>形式返还。充返详细规则将在近期公布。<br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>Q：我用安卓设备测试，正式服如果换了别的设备如何领取返利？</b><br />\nA：极心测试的充返资源是<font color=\"gray\"><b>跟随账号、多端互通</b></font>的，团长公测时可以在<font color=\"gray\"><b>任意终端</b></font>（安卓、iOS、PC）登录<font color=\"gray\"><b>同一账号</b></font>领取。<br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>Q：未满18岁可以参与此次测试吗?</b><br />\nA：为响应国家相关规定，本次测试将开启<font color=\"gray\"><b>未成年人防沉迷与实名认证系统</b></font>，仅对<font color=\"gray\"><b>已满18周岁用户</b></font>开放，未实名注册或未成年用户无法参与测试。<br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>Q：没有资格想要借一个或者交易账号可以吗？</b><br />\nA：小场记严肃地提醒团长们，请<font color=\"gray\"><b>务必保护好个人财产</b></font>，不要轻信任何游戏安装包出售与测试账号共享/交易的信息，切勿在其他平台<font color=\"gray\"><b>购买游戏安装包或测试账号</b></font>，以免造成不必要损失。同时，也请已获得测试资格的团长<font color=\"gray\"><b>保护好个人信息</b></font>，遵守测试要求，<font color=\"gray\"><b>请勿共享/出售自己的测试账号</b></font>。<br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>Q：如果测试期间遇到问题，在哪里反馈？</b><br />\nA：因本次测试为<font color=\"gray\"><b>技术封闭测试</b></font>，故测试包中可能会出现<font color=\"gray\"><b>BUG和其他测试问题</b></font>，如团长在测试过程遇到BUG，请第一时间截屏记录，并：<br />\n·通过游戏内联系客服反馈问题<br />\n·在之后发布的Bug&amp;建议征集帖下方按指定格式进行反馈<br />\n·加入官方Q群：971739685，联系管理员进行反馈\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163730\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 167/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2146/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 280/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.638      1 -total\n 51.33%   16.752      1 模板:面包屑\n 48.38%   15.789      1 模板:文章戳\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:3146-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022163730 and revision id 6698. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"公告"}],"images":["官方消息192.png","官方消息220.png","官方消息221.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"铃兰之剑「极心测试」FAQ","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"铃兰之剑「极心测试」FAQ","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"铃兰之剑「极心测试」FAQ"}],"displaytitle":"铃兰之剑「极心测试」FAQ","wikitext":"{{面包屑|官方消息|公告}}\n=铃兰之剑「极心测试」FAQ=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=公告\n|时间= 2023-09-15 16:52\n|作者=极心测试的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=官方微信公众号\n|原文地址=https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/76sBNGuXM4bW_WWZEBLZ2Q\n}}\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<br>\n[[file:官方消息192.png|560px|link=]]<br>\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n'''Q：测试资格怎么获得？'''<br>\nA：极心测试将于9月27日开启，测试资格会在<font color=gray>'''9月26日'''</font>开放预下载时在<font color=gray>'''TapTap（安卓端）'''</font>放出，本次测试资格<font color=gray>'''限量抢注'''</font>，团长们先到先得哦~在游戏内创建角色成功即获得资格，不以下载游戏为准。<br>\n另外，<font color=gray>'''2022年参与保密测试并签署保密协议'''</font>的团长，可以直接拥有测试资格。<br>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n'''Q：怎么下载安装？'''<br>\nA：<font color=gray>'''9月26日12:00 '''</font>预下载开启时，将会在<font color=gray>'''TapTap安卓端-铃兰之剑 页面'''</font>开放下载地址。团长直接点击下载就可以啦！<br>*本次测试入口<font color=gray>'''仅在TapTap安卓端开放'''</font>，iOS及PC端团长请移步安卓端进行预下载。<br>\n[[file:官方消息220.png|560px|link=]]\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n'''Q：有没有具体的机型要求？'''<br>\nA：本次测试仅开放<font color=gray>'''TapTap安卓安装包'''</font>，暂不支持iOS和PC。<font color=gray>'''安卓设备'''</font>配置要求如下：<br>\n[[file:官方消息221.png|560px|link=]]\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n'''Q：极心测试能否充值？'''<br>\nA：本次测试为<font color=gray>'''限量付费删档测试'''</font>，开放<font color=gray>'''充值入口'''</font>，充值金额将在<font color=gray>'''正式服以资源'''</font>形式返还。充返详细规则将在近期公布。<br>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n'''Q：我用安卓设备测试，正式服如果换了别的设备如何领取返利？'''<br>\nA：极心测试的充返资源是<font color=gray>'''跟随账号、多端互通'''</font>的，团长公测时可以在<font color=gray>'''任意终端'''</font>（安卓、iOS、PC）登录<font color=gray>'''同一账号'''</font>领取。<br>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n'''Q：未满18岁可以参与此次测试吗?'''<br>\nA：为响应国家相关规定，本次测试将开启<font color=gray>'''未成年人防沉迷与实名认证系统'''</font>，仅对<font color=gray>'''已满18周岁用户'''</font>开放，未实名注册或未成年用户无法参与测试。<br>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n'''Q：没有资格想要借一个或者交易账号可以吗？'''<br>\nA：小场记严肃地提醒团长们，请<font color=gray>'''务必保护好个人财产'''</font>，不要轻信任何游戏安装包出售与测试账号共享/交易的信息，切勿在其他平台<font color=gray>'''购买游戏安装包或测试账号'''</font>，以免造成不必要损失。同时，也请已获得测试资格的团长<font color=gray>'''保护好个人信息'''</font>，遵守测试要求，<font color=gray>'''请勿共享/出售自己的测试账号'''</font>。<br>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-flow: row; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 196, 162); text-align: right; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">✦</p></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; min-width: 10%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><div style=\"background-color: rgb(213, 196, 162); height: 1px; visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n'''Q：如果测试期间遇到问题，在哪里反馈？'''<br>\nA：因本次测试为<font color=gray>'''技术封闭测试'''</font>，故测试包中可能会出现<font color=gray>'''BUG和其他测试问题'''</font>，如团长在测试过程遇到BUG，请第一时间截屏记录，并：<br>\n·通过游戏内联系客服反馈问题<br>\n·在之后发布的Bug&建议征集帖下方按指定格式进行反馈<br>\n·加入官方Q群：971739685，联系管理员进行反馈\n<br><br>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:37:31.215134+00:00"}